                <mxCell id="anno_l1" value="How the model connects to data.&#xa;• Ungrounded: Creative generation&#xa;• Curated: RAG with internal docs&#xa;• Live: RAG with APIs, web search" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#334155;fontColor=#cbd5e1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
