                <mxCell id="anno_l2" value="The degree of independent action.&#xa;• Assistive: Helps a user complete a task.&#xa;• Autonomous: Completes a task on its own." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#334155;fontColor=#cbd5e1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
