                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="anno_l3" value="How users and systems interact with the AI.&#xa;• Copilot: Embedded in user's workflow.&#xa;• Assistant: Conversational (chat).&#xa;• Agent: Autonomous, goal-driven." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#334155;fontColor=#cbd5e1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
