                <mxCell id="anno_l4" value="The level of risk management and oversight.&#xa;• Open: Minimal restrictions.&#xa;• Guarded: Input/output filters, basic monitoring.&#xa;• Audited: Strict logging, human review, compliance." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#0f172a;strokeColor=#334155;fontColor=#cbd5e1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
